	(text "HEADERS ONLY - NO ARBITRATION.\n\nHow the three modules' outputs combine into one actuator command\nis an open design question. TmrVoter is not wired into\nmotor_task, so there is no decision to implement yet.\n\nAll three sets are brought out. The arbitration mechanism is\ndeliberately left to a separately scoped decision rather than\nguessed at here - copper is the hardest thing on this board to\nchange later."
